      "en": {
        "number": "G-TD09/011EN",
        "name": "Steam Sniper, Lishma",
        "text": "Time Leap-[AUTO](RC):[Soul-Blast 1 & Choose a card from your hand, and discard it] At the end of the battle that this unit boosted ([Boost]) a vanguard, you may pay the cost. If you do, time leap this unit. (Bind it, call a grade +1 card from your deck, and shuffle your deck. At the end of the turn, put the called unit on the bottom of your deck, and call the bound card)\n[AUTO][Generation Break 1](This ability is active if you have one or more face up G units in total on your (VC) or G zone):[Counter-Blast 1] When this unit is placed on (RC) from your bind zone, you may pay the cost. If you do, draw a card.",
